* Source: Datasheets/Diodes/BAT54_series_Nexperia.pdf
* Per-junction VF maximum anchors and capacitance from this datasheet.
* IS/N/RS fitted to VF maxima; CJO shape VJ=1 M=.5 assumed.
* No validated switching, leakage, temperature drift, breakdown or thermal coupling.
* TT=0 no minority-carrier storage assigned to Schottky. Datasheet maximum trr is not fitted by adding diffusion charge. Rated reverse voltage is not BV.
